    {
      "id": "e4af4f134f4e1fb77a7fa42891ccb39b7ab56871",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 872827270,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Downvoted, since this is premature IMHO. First consensus is to be reached _if_ and _what_ formatting _rules_ are to be used for code. Then a choice can be made on how marshal submissions according to these choices. Trying to 'force' such matters by pushing an MR is not the way to go IMHO.",
